# Automatic testing task filing is disabled

The owner retired the automatic testing-task process on November 3, 2026.
Do not automatically create app tasks, links, assignments, list memberships,
or reminders after fixes, features, releases, or chat summaries.

Record validation results in the requested deliverable or response. Create
an app testing task only when the user explicitly asks for that task.

The former shared list was `Testing Needed | Updates and Fixes`
(`task_lists.id = 10`, `task_projects.id = 3`). Do not recreate its cleared
test backlog or restore this automation from an older checkout.
